Extract Bank Statements data from the supplied document page.
Return one valid JSON object matching the supplied output schema.
Use only evidence visible in the document. Use null when a value is absent.

Fields:
- start_date: start date of bank statement period
- start_date: beginning date of bank statement period
- end_date: end date of bank statement period. do not return the date of the next statement period
- end_date: ending date of bank statement period
- customer_name: customer name
- customer_address: customer address. omit customer or company name from address. do not return the address of the bank
- beginning_balance: beginning balance
- beginning_balance: beginning balance as listed in the account summary
- ending_balance: ending balance of statement
- transactions: Extract transactions
- checks: Extract checks

